# runtime prebuilts built by build-aarch64-musl-runtimes.sh into Soong module variants).
# ==== NOTE: consumption is incomplete — enabling musl_arm64 as a host makes the whole AOSP
# ==== host graph analyze; arm64-memtag-note injection + test-module ripples remain (README).
# ============================================================================
